209
00:10:51.855 --> 00:10:53.389
<i>Kalau begitu aku tidak mengerti</i>

210
00:10:53.423 --> 00:10:54.990
<i>kenapa kamu berbicara denganku.</i>

211
00:10:55.024 --> 00:10:56.825
<i>Itu langkah yang logis.</i>

212
00:10:56.893 --> 00:10:58.260
