217
00:11:04.234 --> 00:11:06.201
<i>Kau memberi mereka kesempatan kedua.</i>

218
00:11:06.236 --> 00:11:07.936
<i>Dan mereka memenuhi keinginan Anda</i>

219
00:11:07.971 --> 00:11:09.872
