227
00:11:18.548 --> 00:11:20.582
<i>Pahlawan belasan kali lipat.</i>

228
00:11:20.617 --> 00:11:22.985
<i>Tapi sekarang dia monster.</i>

229
00:11:23.019 --> 00:11:24.486
